name: ["Aquitect's Will", 'Battle Squadron', 'Blighted Cataract', 'Blighted Gorge', 'Boggart Brute', 'Brittle Effigy', 'Brute Strength', 'Claustrophobia', 'Cleaver Riot', 'Cold-Eyed Selkie', 'Concentrate', 'Ember Hauler', 'Engulf the Shore', 'Essence Scatter', 'Forgotten Cave', 'Foundry Street Denizen', 'Gempalm Incinerator', 'Ghostfire', 'Goblin Charbelcher', 'Goblin Chieftain', 'Goblin Diplomats', 'Goblin Glory Chaser', 'Goblin Goon', 'Goblin Grenade', 'Goblin Rabblemaster', 'Goblin Razerunners', 'Goblin Ringleader', 'Goblin Tunneler', 'Goblin Wardriver', 'Harbinger of the Tides', 'Hordeling Outburst', 'Inkfathom Divers', 'Island', "Krenko's Command", 'Krenko, Mob Boss', 'Lonely Sandbar', 'Master of Waves', 'Master of the Pearl Trident', 'Merfolk Looter', 'Merfolk Sovereign', 'Merfolk Wayfinder', 'Merrow Reejerey', 'Mind Spring', 'Misdirection', 'Mountain', 'Relentless Assault', 'Rootwater Hunter', 'Scroll Thief', 'Streambed Aquitects', 'Tarfire', 'Tidal Courier', 'Tidal Warrior', 'Tidal Wave', 'Tidebinder Mage', 'Triton Tactics', 'Wake Thrasher', 'Warren Instigator']
